          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What are the cases made of?",
            "answer": "<p>Tough and Magnetic cases have a hard polycarbonate shell over a soft TPU lining. Clear cases have a clear polycarbonate back with soft, clear TPU sides. The design is printed onto the case itself.</p>",
            "default_open": false
